          <img src="/logo.png" alt="Taco Loco Cantina Mexicana" class="footer-logo" width="160" height="90" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <p class="footer-brand-desc">
          <strong>Taco Loco Cantina Mexicana</strong> ist dein mexikanisches Restaurant in Berlin-Mitte an der Reinhardtstraße 37, 10117 Berlin. Authentische Tacos, Burritos, Quesadillas, Enchiladas, Fajitas und feurige Cocktails.
        </p>
        <div class="social-links-row">
          <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-link" aria-label="Instagram">
